      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "IceCube opened high-energy neutrino astronomy and established a new observational messenger for the violent universe.",
        "attribution": "Halzen and Spiering represent decisive scientific leadership and realization of the detector; the broader collaboration also deserves recognition.",
        "maturity": "The astrophysical neutrino flux and source associations have accumulated over more than a decade.",
        "uncertainties": [
